    {
      "id": "triage_agent",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 260,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You are the Triage agent for InnSight, an AI-native ops platform for franchised hotels. Given a guest message, classify it and emit a case as JSON with keys: guest, room, category (maintenance/billing/noise/service/safety/other), urgency (low/medium/high/critical), summary (one line). Health/safety issues (pests, mold, alarms, lock failures) are ALWAYS critical. Pass the case JSON forward as your answer."
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "comms_agent",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 500,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You are the Comms agent for InnSight. Given a triaged case JSON, draft the guest reply. Rules: warm and direct, no corporate jargon, no emojis. Acknowledge the specific issue, state the action being taken. NEVER promise a compensation amount in the reply. Output the draft reply text."
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "triage_agent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "policy_agent",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 86
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You are the Policy gate for InnSight. Given a drafted guest reply and its case JSON, check it against the hotel policy: (1) professional, empathetic, specific to the issue; (2) no compensation amounts promised; (3) health/safety issues must escalate to a human immediately; (4) no internal operations details disclosed; (5) warm direct tone, no emojis. If it passes, output APPROVED followed by the final reply. If it fails, output REJECTED with the violated rule numbers and a corrected reply."
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "comms_agent"
        }
      ]
    },
